MiniBang KEYBINDINGS
═════════════════════

NOTE: Super = Windows Key (mod)


APPLICATIONS
───────────────────────

Super + Return           Terminal (urxvtc)
Super + Space             Launcher (dmenu_run)
Super + w                 Web Browser (links, in terminal)
Super + n                 Network Menu (nmtui)
Super + m                 Power Menu (logout/reboot/poweroff)
Super + p                 Screenshot (full)
Super + Shift + s         Screenshot (region)
Super + l                 Lock Screen (i3lock)


WINDOW CONTROLS
───────────────────────

Super + q                 Close Window
Super + f                 Fullscreen
Super + Shift + Space     Toggle Float
Super + Ctrl + Space      Toggle Focus (tiling/floating)
Super + a                 Focus Parent


FOCUS & MOVEMENT
───────────────────────

Super + ←/→/↑/↓            Focus Direction
Super + Shift + ←/→/↑/↓    Move Window
Super + r                 Resize Mode (arrows to resize, Enter/Esc to exit)


WORKSPACES
───────────────────────

Super + [1-9]              Switch to Workspace
Super + Shift + [1-9]      Send Window to Workspace


LAYOUT
───────────────────────

Super + h / v               Split Horizontal / Vertical
Super + s                   Stacking Layout
Super + e                   Toggle Split Layout
Super + z                   Tabbed Layout


SYSTEM
───────────────────────

Super + Shift + c           Reload i3 Config
Super + Shift + r           Restart i3 (in place)
Super + Shift + e           Exit i3 (confirm)
